    "summary": "Absence, visible surface and collision, followed by removing the light that casts their shadows.",
    "layout": "19 × 17. Corridor: absent (7,2), visible (7,5), solid (7,8). Wall switch (10,6) faces the corridor. A 1.3 m sphere stands at (8,12). Exit to Point_Coordinates.",
